NInfer-HIP
==========

This project is a derivative work of NInfer (https://github.com/Neroued/ninfer),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications: substantial portions of the engine have been modified and/or
rewritten to run on the AMD HIP / ROCm stack (RDNA4 / gfx1201), including the
attention kernels, KV cache codecs, GGUF quantization bridge, speculative
decoding (MTP) path and the memory planner. The per-file list of changes, with
rollback points, is maintained in docs/PATCHLIST.md.

Third-party components bundled under src/infer/third_party keep their own
licenses (ggml-quants, cpp-httplib, llama-jinja, nlohmann/json, spdlog, utf8proc);
see the LICENSE files in each subdirectory.

The model weights are NOT included in this repository. The artifact referenced
in the documentation (Qwen3.8-27B-GSQ-RCO-IQ3_S, WaveCut) is distributed by its
own authors under their own terms.

